{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating journey with <i>Skybound Sphere</i>, a fast-paced physics-based adventure where precision, strategy, and teamwork determine your success. Take control of a dynamic ball as it navigates challenging obstacle courses, soaring through platforms, dodging hazards, and racing against time to reach the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Gameplay:</strong> Play solo to master your skills, or team up with friends online for cooperative challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Skins &amp; Abilities:</strong> Unlock and equip a variety of skins and unique abilities that let you express yourself and gain strategic advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Abilities:</strong> Use the <strong>F key</strong> to activate special powers, and the <strong>R key</strong> to perform advanced teleportation moves to overcome complex obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Physics-Based Obstacles:</strong> Navigate moving platforms, traps, and environmental hazards that test your timing and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive &amp; Cooperative Modes:</strong> Compete for the fastest time, or work together to solve puzzles and reach the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Rewards:</strong> Earn new skins, abilities, and customization options as you conquer levels and master the challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift key</strong> \u2013 Brake key, press without touching the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD or Arrow keys</strong> \u2013 Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space key</strong> \u2013 Jump; if you press it again right after landing, boosted jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R key</strong> \u2013 Teleport</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing alone or with friends, <i>Skybound Sphere</i> combines precision, creativity, and fun in a vibrant world full of thrilling challenges. Can you reach the finish line and unlock all the secrets hidden along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, teleport, and roll your way to victory\u2014your adventure begins now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Can Aero?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097410/6f6144f845b9a3b7a4227f0cd20be90d2a66f64d.jpg"},{"name":"Wtf Aero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097410/22e600b80d7272e35ddcaaa4cc8d668f07f15572.jpg"},{"name":"Finish Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097410/31c53d44c9729e613e5ac382a09b530232ff5e59.jpg"},{"name":"New Particle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4097410/039286234887cd21af906bad4c278afefa242dd6.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097410?t=1762601761","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097410?t=1762601761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097410/8c62d41aeeb2bf3c75a96f806d27fdb18d03cbbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762601761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097410/8c62d41aeeb2bf3c75a96f806d27fdb18d03cbbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762601761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating journey with <i>Skybound Sphere</i>, a fast-paced physics-based adventure where precision, strategy, and teamwork determine your success. Take control of a dynamic ball as it navigates challenging obstacle courses, soaring through platforms, dodging hazards, and racing against time to reach the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Gameplay:</strong> Play solo to master your skills, or team up with friends online for cooperative challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Skins &amp; Abilities:</strong> Unlock and equip a variety of skins and unique abilities that let you express yourself and gain strategic advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Abilities:</strong> Use the <strong>F key</strong> to activate special powers, and the <strong>R key</strong> to perform advanced teleportation moves to overcome complex obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Physics-Based Obstacles:</strong> Navigate moving platforms, traps, and environmental hazards that test your timing and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive &amp; Cooperative Modes:</strong> Compete for the fastest time, or work together to solve puzzles and reach the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Rewards:</strong> Earn new skins, abilities, and customization options as you conquer levels and master the challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift key</strong> \u2013 Brake key, press without touching the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD or Arrow keys</strong> \u2013 Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space key</strong> \u2013 Jump; if you press it again right after landing, boosted jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R key</strong> \u2013 Teleport</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing alone or with friends, <i>Skybound Sphere</i> combines precision, creativity, and fun in a vibrant world full of thrilling challenges. Can you reach the finish line and unlock all the secrets hidden along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, teleport, and roll your way to victory\u2014your adventure begins now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["yavuz sinan akta\u015f"],"dlc":[4109450],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097410/49f611c1e3f6fb244e94c1cdf5f7d41975c87446/header.jpg?t=1762601761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097410/1267621447/a0b31c02f03e8460e7f9e00cd5a7571d0e5b6ac3/1761996396/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761998197","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097410/1267621447/a0b31c02f03e8460e7f9e00cd5a7571d0e5b6ac3/1761996396/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761998197","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097410/1267621447/a0b31c02f03e8460e7f9e00cd5a7571d0e5b6ac3/1761996396/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761998197","id":257225461,"name":"PlayThrough","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225461/01aa6e66e551bab3863929077e1d236af3380fd9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761998197"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097410/1613050239/d27c864c45332e4fa1d0a7ee30e13c6b4824e611/1761666436/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761998199","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097410/1613050239/d27c864c45332e4fa1d0a7ee30e13c6b4824e611/1761666436/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761998199","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.